1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,666
[metal clashing]

2
00:00:03,666 --> 00:00:07,666
The Tiny Loser Chamber needs to be fixed!

3
00:00:08,541 --> 00:00:10,333
Help me get it fixed!

4
00:00:10,458 --> 00:00:13,250
Please! Be quiet, and leave me alone!

5
00:00:13,458 --> 00:00:13,875
Hup!

6
00:00:16,125 --> 00:00:18,500
- It's a message!
- What's it say?

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,291
"We are currently building an
Announcer Recovery Center...

8
00:00:21,291 --> 00:00:22,500
It will be done soon."

9
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,500
Signed, Flykydfly.

10
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,791
Well that's good. I miss the old Announcer.

11
00:00:26,791 --> 00:00:27,916
I can't wait to have him back!

12
00:00:27,916 --> 00:00:29,333
- Wow!
- Ice Cube!

13
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:31,625
You're supposed to be in the TLC.
How did you escape?

14
00:00:31,708 --> 00:00:34,625
T-there's a giant gaping hog hole in the wall, so...

15
00:00:34,625 --> 00:00:36,541
- Coiny: Wow, thanks for stating the obvious.
- Firey: Huh! What? What's that?

16
00:00:36,916 --> 00:00:42,083
Oh, hello, Coiny! It's good to see that
you're finally where you belong.

17
00:00:42,083 --> 00:00:43,375
[rapid slapping]

18
00:00:43,916 --> 00:00:50,500
[INTRO PLAYS]

19
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,500
Subtitles: TAFFYMARZI

20
00:00:53,166 --> 00:00:56,041
See? I told you the TLC needed to be fixed!

21
00:00:56,041 --> 00:00:58,291
Yeah, that's true. But how are you gonna fix it?

22
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,916
Well, I just need some more metal to fix it and...

23
00:01:00,916 --> 00:01:03,875
you guys are... metal, uhm, so... yeah...

24
00:01:05,083 --> 00:01:07,750
I don't want to go first!
Bubble, you go first!

25
00:01:07,750 --> 00:01:08,166
Ahhh!-

26
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,708
Who's next? Who's next?
Leafy, who should go next?

27
00:01:11,708 --> 00:01:16,208
Hmm... Aha! Ice Cube, come on down,
you can be in my alloy!

28
00:01:16,208 --> 00:01:17,875
Ahhhh!

29
00:01:17,875 --> 00:01:19,083
Uh, why would you do that?

30
00:01:19,083 --> 00:01:21,291
- She isn't even made of metal.
- Firey, don't question it.

31
00:01:21,291 --> 00:01:23,166
- Just jump in!
- Ahhhh!

32
00:01:23,458 --> 00:01:24,500
Who's next, Leafy?

33
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:25,666
- How about you?
- What?! No!

34
00:01:25,666 --> 00:01:26,708
You have to go in eventually!

35
00:01:26,708 --> 00:01:28,083
Well, I can't go in now. I-

36
00:01:28,083 --> 00:01:30,291
Leafy, Spongy, and Flower:
Ahhhh!

37
00:01:31,625 --> 00:01:33,458
Yes! Now I finally have enough.

38
00:01:35,291 --> 00:01:38,541
Yes, I'm no longer metal! I don't weigh
like a thousand pounds anymore!

39
00:01:38,541 --> 00:01:42,083
Whoa! The Tiny Loser Chamber... it's been fixed!

40
00:01:42,291 --> 00:01:44,750
One of you will be sent to the TLC in about one minute

41
00:01:44,750 --> 00:01:47,041
and one of you will be sent to the TLC in 5 seconds.

42
00:01:47,208 --> 00:01:49,000
Sorry Ice Cube, I guess you have to go back.

43
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,166
- Wha?
- [whisper] Sorry...

44
00:01:53,458 --> 00:01:54,750
Now, let's do Cake at Stake.

45
00:01:55,541 --> 00:01:56,916
♪ The points are gone ♪

46
00:01:56,916 --> 00:01:58,708
♪ We are free of them now ♪

47
00:01:58,708 --> 00:01:59,958
♪ But we look on ♪

48
00:02:01,166 --> 00:02:03,166
♪ To the moment that we see ♪

49
00:02:03,625 --> 00:02:05,791
♪ The next slice of cake ♪

50
00:02:05,791 --> 00:02:07,958
♪ A step closer to the prize ♪

51
00:02:07,958 --> 00:02:09,791
♪ Brought on by Cake at Stake ♪

52
00:02:16,916 --> 00:02:18,458
Hey guys, I'm back.

53
00:02:18,833 --> 00:02:20,291
Who's this? An impostor?

54
00:02:20,291 --> 00:02:21,708
No, no, no, I'm your replacement.

55
00:02:21,708 --> 00:02:23,166
- And I'm his clone.
- Say what?

56
00:02:23,166 --> 00:02:24,666
Both:
We are also clones!

57
00:02:24,666 --> 00:02:26,083
You people are all too weird.

58
00:02:26,083 --> 00:02:27,833
- Please leave.
- No discrimination, please.

59
00:02:27,833 --> 00:02:30,041
I am the circular floating globe.

60
00:02:30,041 --> 00:02:31,416
And I'm the Cheese Orb!

61
00:02:31,416 --> 00:02:33,250
I throw spike balls uncontrollably!

62
00:02:33,250 --> 00:02:35,666
Hey, um, let's just get to the elimination.

63
00:02:35,666 --> 00:02:37,333
Yeah, let's... let's do that.

64
00:02:37,625 --> 00:02:38,500
Bwahhh!

65
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:41,666
816 voters voted. It went down again.

66
00:02:41,666 --> 00:02:42,625
Please don't cry!

67
00:02:42,666 --> 00:02:44,125
Don't worry. I'm okay.

68
00:02:44,333 --> 00:02:48,958
But if it goes down for a third time in a row,
I swear I'll cancel BFDI.

69
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:51,625
Would you please stop distracting me?

70
00:02:51,666 --> 00:02:53,416
So, what's the cake this time?

71
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:55,125
- It's cheesecake.
- But we don't have any-

72
00:02:56,500 --> 00:02:57,166
Now we do.

73
00:02:57,250 --> 00:02:59,666
Oh no! Speaker just killed the Cheese Orb!

74
00:02:59,666 --> 00:03:01,125
Cheese Orb was my friend!

75
00:03:01,250 --> 00:03:04,000
Four of the five of you are safe, and will get cake.

76
00:03:04,291 --> 00:03:05,708
One of you will be eliminated.

77
00:03:06,416 --> 00:03:09,250
Flower and Firey had immunity, so they get cake.

78
00:03:09,875 --> 00:03:12,833
With only 97 votes against her, Bubble is safe.

79
00:03:13,541 --> 00:03:16,125
Spongy and Leafy, one of you will be eliminated.

80
00:03:16,125 --> 00:03:17,291
- Leafy: Bmbmbmbmbmbmbmbmbmb!
- Spongy: Wha?!

81
00:03:17,291 --> 00:03:21,041
The contestant who is safe with only 287 votes is-

82
00:03:21,041 --> 00:03:23,500
- It's Leafy.
- Oh my gosh, would you just be quiet?

83
00:03:23,625 --> 00:03:24,666
But is it true?

84
00:03:24,666 --> 00:03:26,166
- Yes. Spongy...
- Huh?

85
00:03:26,166 --> 00:03:30,041
...with a record of 432 votes,
you've been eliminated, again.

86
00:03:32,416 --> 00:03:34,000
Yeah, final four, Firey!

87
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,500
Do you realize that there is only one
more elimination before the finals?

88
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:38,166
Woah!

89
00:03:38,166 --> 00:03:41,041
That means that this is the last contest of BFDI.

90
00:03:41,041 --> 00:03:42,583
And what is the last contest?

91
00:03:42,583 --> 00:03:45,166
Announcer:
It's a combination of all the previous contests.

92
00:03:45,166 --> 00:03:46,000
Ooh, cool!

93
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:49,708
The first person to complete all the
contests in order wins immunity.

94
00:03:49,708 --> 00:03:52,958
If you die, you have to start all over again. Go.

95
00:03:55,041 --> 00:03:56,958
Out of my way, I need my space!

96
00:03:57,875 --> 00:03:59,000
Firey:
Ahhhh!

97
00:04:02,708 --> 00:04:03,125
Haha!

98
00:04:03,583 --> 00:04:04,083
Huh?

99
00:04:05,083 --> 00:04:06,750
Huh, I deserve the one with the motor!

100
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:09,791
Hup!

101
00:04:10,666 --> 00:04:11,208
Ohh...

102
00:04:12,458 --> 00:04:13,166
Faster!

103
00:04:14,666 --> 00:04:16,833
Well I never did this contest! This is unfair!

104
00:04:17,541 --> 00:04:17,833
Huh?

105
00:04:18,125 --> 00:04:19,291
Firey, I'll wait for you!

106
00:04:21,375 --> 00:04:22,916
Bubble, get me to the top of the rock wall!

107
00:04:22,916 --> 00:04:24,875
No, Flower, you have to do it yourself.

108
00:04:24,875 --> 00:04:26,666
What? And to think you're nice!

109
00:04:27,541 --> 00:04:30,791
Firey! You can have the larger boat,
because I know you can't touch water.

110
00:04:30,791 --> 00:04:31,791
Wow, thanks!

111
00:04:36,791 --> 00:04:38,833
Bubble, y-you have to get me to the top!

112
00:04:38,833 --> 00:04:40,041
- You have to!
- No!

113
00:04:40,041 --> 00:04:42,166
If you don't help me, I'll... I'll pop you!

114
00:04:42,166 --> 00:04:43,583
- You wouldn't!
- Oh yeah?!

115
00:04:44,708 --> 00:04:45,125
Huh?!

116
00:04:45,708 --> 00:04:47,125
Ahhhh!

117
00:04:47,125 --> 00:04:48,541
Oh, why, hello!

118
00:04:51,375 --> 00:04:53,208
Oh no, no boats left!

119
00:04:53,208 --> 00:04:54,583
It's okay, we can swim!

120
00:04:54,583 --> 00:04:55,666
Oh, okay!

121
00:04:57,666 --> 00:05:00,041
Hey! It's my boat! I must have let go of it earlier.

122
00:05:00,041 --> 00:05:00,916
So, um...

123
00:05:00,916 --> 00:05:02,083
You can use it, Bubble!

124
00:05:02,083 --> 00:05:03,333
Really? Thanks!

125
00:05:05,083 --> 00:05:06,875
Firey, you'll get me to the top!

126
00:05:06,875 --> 00:05:08,916
- No!
- I'll extinguish you!

127
00:05:08,916 --> 00:05:10,333
- No, you won't!
- Oh yeah?!

128
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:11,041
Firey:
Huh?!

129
00:05:11,166 --> 00:05:12,000
Euugh!

130
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,291
Firey's about to fall into the water!

131
00:05:13,291 --> 00:05:14,291
Huu-EUUUGH!

132
00:05:14,291 --> 00:05:15,000
I'll save you!

133
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:16,583
- Huu-Ahhhh!
- Yes! Ow, hot!

134
00:05:16,583 --> 00:05:19,041
Ahhhhh!

135
00:05:19,875 --> 00:05:22,833
Bubble, now it's just the two of us.
Now get me to the top!

136
00:05:22,833 --> 00:05:25,125
I am only doing this because
you'll kill me if I don't!

137
00:05:25,125 --> 00:05:27,291
Yes! Three, two, one!

138
00:05:27,291 --> 00:05:28,166
- Guh!
- Wheee!

139
00:05:28,166 --> 00:05:29,541
Ahhhhh!

140
00:05:30,416 --> 00:05:33,625
Oh no, all the boats are gone,
and you know I can't swim.

141
00:05:33,625 --> 00:05:35,875
I'll swim, Firey, and you can stand on my head!

142
00:05:35,875 --> 00:05:36,458
Really?

143
00:05:36,458 --> 00:05:37,875
As long as you don't set me on fire!

144
00:05:37,875 --> 00:05:38,666
Wow, thanks!

145
00:05:39,375 --> 00:05:40,791
- Firey: This is great!
- Flower: Ahhhhh!

146
00:05:40,791 --> 00:05:41,291
- Flower: Ahhhhh!
- Leafy: Huh?

147
00:05:41,291 --> 00:05:41,750
Flower:
Ahhhhh!

148
00:05:42,541 --> 00:05:43,583
No, don't die!

149
00:05:43,625 --> 00:05:45,125
♪ Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo! ♪

150
00:05:45,666 --> 00:05:46,500
Yoylecake!

151
00:05:51,125 --> 00:05:51,583
Done!

152
00:05:52,166 --> 00:05:53,000
Oh no!

153
00:05:54,625 --> 00:05:56,208
[Firey pants] Hup!

154
00:05:56,583 --> 00:05:57,208
Ha-ha!

155
00:05:59,666 --> 00:06:00,708
Oh no!

156
00:06:05,791 --> 00:06:06,416
Done!

157
00:06:06,708 --> 00:06:07,208
Yay!

158
00:06:08,166 --> 00:06:08,708
Yes!

159
00:06:10,041 --> 00:06:11,208
Oh noio!

160
00:06:11,208 --> 00:06:12,833
Hup! Hey, Bubble, what happened?

161
00:06:12,833 --> 00:06:14,833
I failed the test three times!

162
00:06:14,833 --> 00:06:15,875
I think I can help you!

163
00:06:15,875 --> 00:06:16,500
Really?

164
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:20,500
Yeah! All you have to know for the test is
that you can survive 1338 days without eating,

165
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:21,875
and that you like tennis balls!

166
00:06:22,083 --> 00:06:23,083
- That's it?
- Yeah!

167
00:06:23,333 --> 00:06:24,791
So, we have to make a cake.

168
00:06:24,791 --> 00:06:28,500
Well, I remember Coiny made a
delicious dirt cake, so I'm getting that, too.

169
00:06:28,666 --> 00:06:30,958
But Coiny's so dumb! Don't follow his ways!

170
00:06:30,958 --> 00:06:32,166
Whatever, I'm moving on.

171
00:06:32,541 --> 00:06:35,166
Guh! Ahhhhh!

172
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,583
Yoy-le-cake!

173
00:06:40,208 --> 00:06:40,875
Yay!

174
00:06:41,375 --> 00:06:45,875
Firey, why are you actually baking a cake?
A clump of dirt would work just as well.

175
00:06:45,875 --> 00:06:47,041
Yeah, I think I'll do that too!

176
00:06:47,041 --> 00:06:49,208
Firey:
OMG, what has Coiny done to you?!

177
00:06:51,083 --> 00:06:52,409
Leafy and Bubble:
Hup! Hup! Hup!

178
00:06:58,541 --> 00:07:00,333
Leafy and Bubble:
Waaaaaah!

179
00:07:06,166 --> 00:07:07,666
Oh, no. This is a maroon ball!

180
00:07:08,375 --> 00:07:09,666
Hup! Hup! Hup! Hup!

181
00:07:16,208 --> 00:07:16,625
Hup!

182
00:07:17,041 --> 00:07:20,625
So, all I have to do is escape,
and I've got immunity into the final 3!

183
00:07:20,625 --> 00:07:22,000
- That's right!
- Woah!

184
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,541
How did you guys catch up so quickly?

185
00:07:23,541 --> 00:07:25,208
Psh, well it was pretty easy.

186
00:07:25,208 --> 00:07:27,041
And now I'm going to win immunity!

187
00:07:27,041 --> 00:07:28,083
No, you're not, Flower!

188
00:07:29,250 --> 00:07:29,791
Oh no!

189
00:07:30,083 --> 00:07:30,500
Ahh!

190
00:07:31,625 --> 00:07:33,750
Huh? Wait, what does 'Delete Pole' mean?

191
00:07:35,583 --> 00:07:37,041
Good thing I can survive in lava.

192
00:07:37,041 --> 00:07:39,750
But not water, can you?! Ha-ha!

193
00:07:39,750 --> 00:07:42,291
Ahhhhh!

194
00:07:42,416 --> 00:07:45,250
Well, it's going to be a long time before
Firey and Flower get here again.

195
00:07:45,250 --> 00:07:47,125
So I guess it's just the two of us!

196
00:07:47,125 --> 00:07:49,125
- I think you should win the immunity, Bubble!
- Uhm,

197
00:07:49,125 --> 00:07:52,791
Leafy, no offense, but I'm tired of
you being so nice all the time.

198
00:07:53,458 --> 00:07:53,875
What?!

199
00:07:53,875 --> 00:07:56,750
It's not much fun when I know you'll
probably let me win anyway.

200
00:07:56,750 --> 00:07:57,666
There's no challenge!

201
00:07:57,666 --> 00:08:00,416
You mean all this time, I've been trying to
help you and you're not even thankful?

202
00:08:00,416 --> 00:08:02,750
- Well, I didn't mean to say that!
- I was right about you.

203
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:04,458
You are the meanest person on EARTH!

204
00:08:04,625 --> 00:08:06,458
No, I am thankful, it's just-

205
00:08:06,458 --> 00:08:08,041
I bet you'd rather be with Flower, wouldn't you?

206
00:08:08,041 --> 00:08:09,291
Yeah! She would!

207
00:08:09,291 --> 00:08:10,125
See? I knew it.

208
00:08:10,125 --> 00:08:11,250
No, Leafy, I-

209
00:08:11,250 --> 00:08:13,125
Bubble even helped me over the rock wall!

210
00:08:13,541 --> 00:08:14,166
You WHAT?!

211
00:08:14,166 --> 00:08:15,875
No, that's only because
she threatened me to-

212
00:08:15,875 --> 00:08:17,875
I don't wanna hear it, Bubble!
Our friendship is over!

213
00:08:17,875 --> 00:08:20,166
Well ours, Bubble, has just begun!

214
00:08:20,166 --> 00:08:21,625
Now get me out of this volcano!

215
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:22,958
Three, two, one-

216
00:08:23,125 --> 00:08:24,000
Wait! What are you doing?

217
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,416
Ahhhh!

218
00:08:27,916 --> 00:08:30,208
Bubble, you win the final immunity ticket.

219
00:08:30,458 --> 00:08:33,916
So Firey, Flower and Leafy are
up for the final elimination.

220
00:08:34,208 --> 00:08:35,083
- Firey?
- Yeah?

221
00:08:35,083 --> 00:08:38,125
For dying the most in this episode, you get a penalty.

222
00:08:38,125 --> 00:08:39,541
What? Ugh, what is it?

223
00:08:39,541 --> 00:08:41,000
Announcer:
You have to hold this sign.

224
00:08:41,375 --> 00:08:43,000
Uhm... This doesn't seem too bad.

225
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:49,000
Voters, viewers and everyone, vote who you
think should be eliminated by commenting on this video.

226
00:08:54,083 --> 00:08:56,791
Hey wait, so if there's an
Announcer Recovery Center now,

227
00:08:56,791 --> 00:08:58,458
we can kill the Announcer as much as we want.

228
00:08:58,458 --> 00:09:00,291
He'll still come back to give us Dream Island!

229
00:09:00,583 --> 00:09:02,541
Oh yeah! Hmmm...